===Etymology 2===
{{der+|en|enm|letten||to hinder, delay}}, from {{der|en|ang|lettan||to hinder, delay”; literally, “to make late}}, from {{der|en|gmw-pro|*lattjan}}, from {{der|en|gem-pro|*latjaną}}. Akin to {{cog|ang|latian||to delay}}, {{cog|nl|letten}}, {{cog|ang|læt||late}}. More at [[late]], [[delay]].

